444163"},{"text":"Nunca olvido una cara.","en":"I never forget a face.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/430390"},{"text":"¿Estás segura de que no olvidas nada?","en":"Are you sure that you haven't forgotten anything?"}]}